WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.910
Two job applications.

2
00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:05.480
Identical in every way except one detail:

3
00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.140
the name at the top.

4
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:14.380
Researchers sent 9,600 applications
like these to 2,400 real job offers.

5
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.870
In French, this method
is called «le testing».

6
00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.580
Who got the call back more often,

7
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.300
and by how much?

8
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.150
And what is France doing about
«la discrimination à l'embauche»?

9
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.980
In this mission, you'll
compare three models of living

10
00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.110
together in Mission D1: «l'assimilation»,

11
00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:33.840
«l'intégration», «le multiculturalisme».

12
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.710
Then you'll see what the law says,

13
00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:38.500
and run the numbers in Mission D2.

14
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.480
Your mission: find out
who gets the call back,

15
00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.310
and what France is doing about it.
